<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58142" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνήμ-η</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνάμα</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νᾱ], ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>part between knee and ankle, leg, shank</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.147
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.135
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				125
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1394
			</span></i>, etc.; of a horse, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.10
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπωτέρω ἢ γόνυ
			κνάμα</span> 'blood is thicker than water', <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				16.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Anat.,
				<i>tibia</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.774
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				123
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in plants,
				<i>stem between two joints</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.13.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνήμη</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνήμου</span>
			)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> μελίνης</span> dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				608
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>spoke</i> of a wheel, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.144
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				598.4
			</span></i>. (Cf. OIr. <i>cnāim</i> 'bone', O<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>
			<i>hamm</i> 'ham'.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
